WEBVTT

NOTE Descriptive action captions. The source recording contains no audible speech.

00:00.000 --> 00:06.500
In Club admin view, open Club Profile.

00:06.750 --> 00:12.750
Club Settings has separate upload areas
for the Home kit and Away kit.

00:13.250 --> 00:17.000
The white Home kit is loaded
into the image preview.

00:17.750 --> 00:23.750
Remove the Home kit image background.

00:24.250 --> 00:27.500
Compare Original with Background removed.
Select Apply to use the result.

00:27.750 --> 00:32.750
The Home kit now has
a transparent background.

00:33.750 --> 00:36.500
The purple Away kit is loaded
into its image preview.

00:37.750 --> 00:40.500
Review the Away kit background-removal preview.
Select Apply to use the result.

00:41.000 --> 00:45.750
Both kit previews are ready to save.

00:46.750 --> 00:48.000
Home kit saved.

00:48.250 --> 00:58.100
Home kit saved. Away kit saved.

